<witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2007-12-01T04:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2007-12-01T04:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>moving -- skid</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Held toolbox talk prior to skidding rig from F-9 to F-1.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2007-12-01T04:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2007-12-01T06:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>moving -- skid</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Skidded rig port. Started to skid rig/cantilever forward.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2007-12-01T06:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2007-12-01T08:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>moving -- skid</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Skidded rig/cantilever forward to slot F-1. Picked up stabd of drillpipe and ran through F-1 slot. Checked allignment over slot and made adjustments accordingly. Built scaffolding around F-1 wellslot. Installed 2nd hatch in moonpool.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2007-12-01T08:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2007-12-01T08:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>drilling -- trip</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Held toolbox talk prior to picking up 36&quot; holeopener BHA.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2007-12-01T08:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2007-12-01T09:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">9</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>drilling -- trip</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Picked up 36&quot; x 26&quot; x 17 1/2&quot; holeopener and hung off in RT. Removed dog collar on drill guide bushing. Made up holeopener to BHA.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2007-12-01T09:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2007-12-01T10:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">133</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>drilling -- drill</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Made up DC and ran in with 36&quot; holeopener BHA to 133 m MD.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2007-12-01T10:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2007-12-01T10:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">144</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>drilling -- drill</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>While observing with ROV, stabbed BHA into funnel at 140 m MD. Tagged seabed at 144,3 m with 5 MT WOB.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2007-12-01T10:45:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2007-12-01T11:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">145</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>drilling -- drill</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Washed down from 144 m to 145 m with 1000 lpm.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2007-12-01T11:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2007-12-01T15:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">165</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>drilling -- drill</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Drilled 36&quot; hole section from 145 m to 165 m MD with reduced drilling parameters : Flow 600-1000 lpm / Rotation 10-25 rpm / WOB 1-3 MT / Torque 3-16 kNm. ROV observed that drill guide bushing landed in funnel. Survey at 165 m MD 0,21 deg. High torque and excessive rattling in string from 160-165 m MD.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2007-12-01T15:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2007-12-01T22:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">226</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>drilling -- drill</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Drilled 36&quot; hole section from 165 m to 17 1/2 TD at 226 m MD / 36&quot; TD at 223 m MD. Drilling parameters : Flow 4100-4400 lpm / Rotation 70-90 rpm /  WOB 1-3 MT / Torque 5-7 kNm. Swept hole with 20 m3 hi-vis before connection. Performed survey every 10 m. Final survey at 226 m MD 0,18 deg.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2007-12-01T22:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2007-12-01T23:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">226</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>drilling -- circulating conditioning</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Ciruculated hole clean by pumping 1,5 x hole volume of seawater while reaming with 10 rpm.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2007-12-01T23:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2007-12-01T23:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">226</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>drilling -- circulating conditioning</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Pumped 25 m3 hi-vis sweep followed by 60 m3 sewater at 4400 lpm. Mechanical popoff on mudpump #3 triggered unintentionally, no pressure spike observed. Discussed situation. Decided to continue operations and displace to 1,40 sg mud using only one mudpump.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2007-12-01T23:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2007-12-02T00:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">226</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>drilling -- circulating conditioning</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Displaced hole from seawater to 1,40 sg WBM pumping with a limited rate of 2200 lpm.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity>
